<title>UK: CRICKET-ENGLAND 169-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V AUSTRALIA - TEA.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-ENGLAND 169-1 IN 2ND INNINGS V AUSTRALIA - TEA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>England were 169 for one in their</p>
<p>second innings at tea, a lead of 33 on the final day of the</p>
<p>second test against Australia on Monday.</p>
<p>Scores: England 77 all out and 169-1, Australia 213-7</p>
<p>declared.</p>
</text>
